# {{lb|en|transitive|uncommon}} To swap or exchange surreptitiously.
#* {{quote-book|en|author=Nancy Krulik|title=All's Fair|year=2013|publisher=Penguin|url=https://books.google.com/books?id=6jI8vBYewf0C&pg=PT9&dq=switcherooed&hl=&cd=1&source=gbs_api#v=onepage&q=switcherooed&f=false|isbn=978-1-101-61089-3|passage=Another day, the magic wind came and '''switcherooed''' Katie into a hairdresser named Sparkle.}}